        {
          "text": "Erini ovuria ’dale o’du izu were ’boria, eri enga acizu pari dri dria angu Galatiaari pi ma eselia Ferugiaari be, eri fe okpo ’ba Yesu vuti bipi ’diyi dri dria.",
